  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup></math></p><p>where,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Number&nbsp;of non-negative integral solution&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Number&nbsp;of non-negative integral solution&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Total number of positive integral solutions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math> is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
